As a footnote to the preceding, I (of course)
followed up checking "know" with checking the
core of one synset(8), "fuck," and found it
markedly underdone.  It gives only ^fuck^1 (well,
I'm not sure it ought to be even the first
meaning) but nothing about its connections with
violence, whether sexual or not.  To be sure,
there was a bit more under "fucking," but still
off the point (^fuck^2 -- I seem to recall that
James McCawley -- or Quang Phuc Dong --
distinguished a couple more senses).







           

